/* The divider is a 1px line, too thin a target for a real mouse; this pseudo widens its HIT area to 7px without widening the line itself. z-index:1 keeps that widened area above __time-body (also position:relative), which would otherwise paint over its right half -- the two are positioned siblings, and __time-body comes later in document order. */
